  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "あいてに　なめられないように　いつもしかめっつらをしているが　ないているこどもは　そのかおで　わらいだす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "상대에게 얕보이지 않기 위해 항상 얼굴을 찌푸리고 있지만 우는 아이는 그 모습을 보고 웃게 된다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "為了不被對手看扁而總是皺著的那張臉，卻反而會讓哭泣的孩子破涕為笑。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il affiche toujours un air renfrogné pour qu’on le prenne au sérieux, mais même les enfants en pleurs éclatent de rire lorsqu’ils voient sa tête.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es blickt stets finster drein, um von anderen ernst genommen zu werden, doch selbst weinende Kinder fangen bei seinem Anblick an zu lachen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mantiene el ceño fruncido para que sus rivales lo tomen en serio, pero hasta el niño más llorón estallaría en carcajadas al ver su mueca.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si mostra sempre accigliato per evitare di essere preso sottogamba, ma il suo buffo muso fa ridere persino i bambini in preda al pianto.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It always scowls in an attempt to make opponents take it seriously, but even crying children will burst into laughter when they see Maschiff’s face.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "相手に　嘗められないように　いつもしかめっ面をしているが　泣いている子どもは　その顔で　笑いだす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "为了不被对手看扁而总是皱着一张脸，却反而会让哭泣的孩子破涕为笑。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mantiene el ceño fruncido para que sus rivales lo tomen en serio, pero hasta el niño más llorón estallaría en carcajadas al ver su mueca.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "はったつした　あごと　キバはいわを　かみくだく　ちからづよさ。あつい　しぼうは　！\u0003\u0007防御力ぼうぎょりょく防御力　ばつぐん。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "발달된 턱과 이빨은 바위도 분쇄할 정도로 강하다. 두꺼운 지방은 우수한 방어력을 자랑한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "發達的顎部和獠牙擁有能咬碎岩石的強大威力。厚厚的脂肪使牠防禦力超群。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa mâchoire et ses crocs bien développés sont assez puissants pour broyer des rochers. Sa graisse épaisse lui octroie une excellente protection.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Kiefer und Fangzähne dieses Pokémon sind gut entwickelt und stark genug, Felsen zu zerbeißen. Seine dicke Fettschicht bietet optimalen Schutz.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Tanto su mandíbula como sus colmillos están tan desarrollados que pueden triturar rocas. Su densa capa de grasa le proporciona una buena defensa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La mandibola e le zanne sono così potenti e ben sviluppate da poter sgretolare la pietra. Lo spesso strato di grasso gli dà un’ottima difesa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its well-developed jaw and fangs are strong enough to crunch through boulders, and its thick fat makes for an excellent defense.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "発達した　あごと　キバは岩を　噛み砕く　力強さ。厚い　脂肪は　！\u0003\u0007防御力ぼうぎょりょく防御力　抜群。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "发达的颚部和獠牙拥有能咬碎岩石的强大威力。厚厚脂肪的防御力相当突出。",
